### ====================================
### 🔔 API de Notificaciones - Tests
### ====================================

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api/v1
@token = 

### ====================================
### 1. LOGIN - Obtener Token
### ====================================
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "carlos.recepcionista@hotel.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ====================================
### 2. OBTENER ALERTAS COMPLETAS
### ====================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/checkout-alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### ====================================
### 3. OBTENER CONTEO (Para Badge)
### ====================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/checkout-count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### ====================================
### 4. TEST con Administrador
### ====================================
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "super.admin@hotel.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Con token de admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/checkout-alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
